# Videos are not committed -- they live in AdditionalMediaSoftVMC/ only.
# The pattern must be case-insensitive: gitignore is case-sensitive on Linux,
# so a bare *.MOV left the lowercase ButtonPressing*.mov files untracked but
# NOT ignored, cluttering every `git status`.
*.[Mm][Oo][Vv]
*.[Mm][Pp]4
*.[Aa][Vv][Ii]
*.[Mm][Kk][Vv]
